  "project_description": "This module provides the Schema.org/PublicationIssue integration in Drupal Schema.org Metatag module.\n\n Requirements \n \n Schema.org Metatag module. \n \n Usage \n \n Enable the schema_publication_issue module on Administration > Extend page. \n Go to Administration > Configuration > Search and metadata > Metatag > tab Settings ( /admin/config/search/metatag/settings ), select the required Content Type (CT) and check the \"Schema.org: PublicationIssue\" checkbox (screenshot). \n Select your entity type and bundle, expand the \" Schema.org: PublicationIssue \" fieldset and fill in the field mappings you want to publish. \n Back to top",
